                        ],
                        "form": "земли́сты"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "33686832-a924-3969-aa83-f474b80e2981",
                        "entry_id": "59ad6295-b228-3824-ba3c-eae069397456",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спец. содержащий много частей земли"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7168670-ff63-4310-adc4-0fc928cf9374",
                                "sense_id": "33686832-a924-3969-aa83-f474b80e2981",
                                "text": "Рядом с речкой, затихшей настолько, что не шевелится течение, я иду среди берез к мостику, ступая радостно по твердой земле, затем спускаюсь под яр на галечник, поднимающий под ногами шум, ― здесь течение быстрее и чище ― снова взбираюсь на землистый яр и всхожу на мостик, по краям которого бортиками лежат стесанные сверху и снизу бревна."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6e05c931-e795-386f-98a2-be6f460c2e03",
                        "entry_id": "59ad6295-b228-3824-ba3c-eae069397456",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. серовато-бледный, напоминающий цвет земли"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "67fafc3d-989c-4e04-9b93-8bb3b1a258ca",
                                "sense_id": "6e05c931-e795-386f-98a2-be6f460c2e03",
                                "text": "Тюрьма победила меня. Кожа лица приобрела нездоровый, землистый оттенок. Лев Николаевич Толстой как-то сравнил этот цвет с цветом проросших картофельных ростков."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9b182ee7-a0ef-4c58-ac62-b8fdcc28c079",
                        "source_entry_id": "59ad6295-b228-3824-ba3c-eae069397456",
                        "target_lang_word": "earthy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "earthy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4965d13b-6849-30aa-ac64-f5adca632061",
                                        "entry_id": "8a138510-abb4-300e-8cfc-1ee9f6d65e2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resembling dirt or soil (i.e. earth)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "432bcb54-ef4b-4dc7-a5a5-476851b8e63a",
                                                "sense_id": "4965d13b-6849-30aa-ac64-f5adca632061",
                                                "text": "The earthy smell of fresh turned loam told me the farmer had started plowing this morning, the definitive sign of spring for me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3aee115b-1a7e-3f91-a273-aae489fb5950",
                                        "entry_id": "8a138510-abb4-300e-8cfc-1ee9f6d65e2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Down-to-earth, not artificial, natural."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97b48ae1-0066-459b-ab94-bf26fa30397e",
                                                "sense_id": "3aee115b-1a7e-3f91-a273-aae489fb5950",
                                                "text": "She was an earthy soul, the salt of the earth as they say of such rural folk, untarnished by false civilization."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5bf6bed8-188f-4ebf-945f-9dc923dd1d3c",
                                                "sense_id": "3aee115b-1a7e-3f91-a273-aae489fb5950",
                                                "text": "Meekly thou didſt reſign this earthy load / Of Death, call'd Life;"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8b81a21-6e68-325c-b17f-d2061d0ee252",
                                        "entry_id": "8a138510-abb4-300e-8cfc-1ee9f6d65e2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Coarse and unrefined, crude."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08687400-e8eb-4fdd-bb4a-e827125394aa",
                                                "sense_id": "c8b81a21-6e68-325c-b17f-d2061d0ee252",
                                                "text": "earthy humour"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78009fe9-d78c-3886-bba6-f9df3baca86d",
                                        "entry_id": "8a138510-abb4-300e-8cfc-1ee9f6d65e2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Like or resembling the earth or of the earth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33d96b1b-5b7c-3b39-85e5-8d71b1c66eca",
                                        "entry_id": "8a138510-abb4-300e-8cfc-1ee9f6d65e2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Covered with earth (mud, dirt)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a283c1cc-8cfd-4b15-b123-b7e4a8572507",
                                                "sense_id": "33d96b1b-5b7c-3b39-85e5-8d71b1c66eca",
                                                "text": "He was wet through with the dew and quite earthy from diving into the burrows the Boy had made for him in the flower bed, and Nana grumbled as she rubbed him off with a corner of her apron."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a4e1f76c-59a9-4b09-98aa-946078d59d15",
                        "source_entry_id": "59ad6295-b228-3824-ba3c-eae069397456",
                        "target_lang_word": "terreux",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "terreux",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "73745ec6-c9f1-34c3-b910-8ffd5c9052cf",
                                        "entry_id": "9dfd9579-b56b-3e24-86b4-f4f5f7e4cdeb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui a rapport à la terre, qui est de la nature de la terre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a14987a-92ad-4db5-a834-82c5d4498bfe",
                                                "sense_id": "73745ec6-c9f1-34c3-b910-8ffd5c9052cf",
                                                "text": "Goût terreux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "941af6fe-4408-4805-a049-8bf380cabf2c",
                                                "sense_id": "73745ec6-c9f1-34c3-b910-8ffd5c9052cf",
                                                "text": "Odeur terreuse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a67889a-0766-3b10-890d-cc7c51b50795",
                                        "entry_id": "9dfd9579-b56b-3e24-86b4-f4f5f7e4cdeb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est mêlé de terre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "914bdb59-3cb7-482a-8b75-7d050e7d8fcd",
                                                "sense_id": "8a67889a-0766-3b10-890d-cc7c51b50795",
                                                "text": "Mais on s'expliquera facilement cette particularité si l'on réfléchit que les minerais de fer, qui sont presque toujours à l'état terreux et présentent très rarement l'éclat métallique, n'avaient rien qui les signalât à l'attention des premiers hommes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec87c18d-a087-3c00-808c-7cc85171b2bb",
                                        "entry_id": "9dfd9579-b56b-3e24-86b4-f4f5f7e4cdeb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est sali de terre, qui est plein de crasse et de poussière."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0afaa395-5bb8-4217-9d8f-6ce6b14b001f",
                                                "sense_id": "ec87c18d-a087-3c00-808c-7cc85171b2bb",
                                                "text": "Il est revenu de son travail avec les mains toutes terreuses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ae59629-6bca-326b-a72c-9dcbf82ba68f",
                                        "entry_id": "9dfd9579-b56b-3e24-86b4-f4f5f7e4cdeb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui a la couleur de la terre ou l’aspect de la terre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c9bcf1b-77e8-4312-bfb0-e3b15d11dfb5",
                                                "sense_id": "8ae59629-6bca-326b-a72c-9dcbf82ba68f",
                                                "text": "Il est là, debout, piteux, le teint terreux : une vraie tronche à caler les roues de corbillard !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ce22311c-0bbd-4015-9b90-e23e15e49e95",
                        "source_entry_id": "59ad6295-b228-3824-ba3c-eae069397456",
                        "target_lang_word": "poussiéreux",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "poussiéreux",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58c4a943-b112-3e37-a9a2-695ae0e8fbb3",
                                        "entry_id": "948752a6-0c2d-3b81-bf70-c757fac0086d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est plein de poussière ; qui est couvert de poussière."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2134d24a-8c3a-41b1-a567-3b3a227212ab",
                                                "sense_id": "58c4a943-b112-3e37-a9a2-695ae0e8fbb3",
                                                "text": "La sécheresse était encore plus forte, et la chaleur non moins intolérable sous le souffle poussiéreux du vent du nord, ce simoun des Pampas."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b71e1bec-318f-4132-a4fa-b3f4107823fb",
                                                "sense_id": "58c4a943-b112-3e37-a9a2-695ae0e8fbb3",
                                                "text": "L'ampoule, qui éclairait cette dégringolade d'objets de toute provenance […] se balançait, poussiéreuse, au bout de son fil, sous la voûte basse où le salpêtre faisait des croûtes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5cd3790-c10c-4e06-b517-7ed8b699c5d4",
                                                "sense_id": "58c4a943-b112-3e37-a9a2-695ae0e8fbb3",
                                                "text": "Il frotte ses mains poussiérieuses l'une contre l'autre pour ne pas salir son pantalon à cinq cents dollars …."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33df0e7e-d2a3-403d-ab06-22d6bb41e691",
                                                "sense_id": "58c4a943-b112-3e37-a9a2-695ae0e8fbb3",
                                                "text": "Ici et là, on voit des péniches accostées à des silos se remplir interminablement de grains poussiéreux."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40fdb912-4d65-317a-8e60-e921a99dc4f0",
                                        "entry_id": "948752a6-0c2d-3b81-bf70-c757fac0086d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vieux, démodé, dépassé, rétrograde, fermé au progrès ou à l'évolution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "pejorative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d294563a-7b3a-4aae-a788-da3ad2dc3e86",
                                                "sense_id": "40fdb912-4d65-317a-8e60-e921a99dc4f0",
                                                "text": "Programme, esprit poussiéreux, idées poussiéreuses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
